    "breadcrumb": "Leviathan PCRMS Documentation \u003e Apps",
    "content": "Install PCRMS Office on iOS/Apple Devices The PCRMS Office app is available for iPhone and iPad through the Apple App Store. Follow this guide to install the app on your Apple device.\nRequirements Device: iPhone or iPad Operating System: iOS 14.0 or later / iPadOS 14.0 or later Storage: At least 100 MB of free space Connection: Internet connection for download and initial setup Installation Steps Method 1: Direct Link Open the App Store Link\nTap on this link from your iOS device: PCRMS Office on App Store You’ll be redirected to the App Store Download the App\nTap the GET button (or the cloud download icon if you’ve downloaded it before) If prompted, authenticate with Face ID, Touch ID, or your Apple ID password Wait for the download and installation to complete Open the App\nTap OPEN from the App Store, or Find the PCRMS Office icon on your home screen and tap it Method 2: Search in App Store Open the App Store\nTap the App Store icon on your home screen Search for the App\nTap the Search tab at the bottom Type “PCRMS Office” in the search bar Tap Search on the keyboard Select the App\nLook for PCRMS Office by Leviathan Systems Tap on the app icon to open its page Install the App\nTap the GET button Authenticate with Face ID, Touch ID, or your Apple ID password if prompted Wait for the installation to complete Launch the App\nTap OPEN or find the app on your home screen First Launch When you open PCRMS Office for the first time:\nGrant Permissions (if requested)\nThe app may request permissions for notifications, camera, or other features Grant permissions as needed for full functionality Sign In\nEnter your Leviathan PCRMS credentials Your username format: yourname@leviathan.systems Use the password provided by your administrator Start Using the App\nOnce logged in, you’ll have access to all your authorized features Updates The App Store automatically updates your apps when new versions are released:\nAutomatic Updates: Enabled by default in iOS Settings Manual Updates: Go to App Store → Your Profile → Scroll to find PCRMS Office → Tap Update To check your automatic update settings:\nOpen Settings on your device Tap App Store Ensure App Updates is turned ON under Automatic Downloads Troubleshooting App Won’t Download Check Storage: Ensure you have enough free space Check Connection: Verify you’re connected to Wi-Fi or cellular data Restart Device: Try restarting your iPhone/iPad Sign Out and In: Sign out of App Store and sign back in Can’t Find the App Ensure you’re searching in the correct region (US App Store) Check that your iOS version meets the minimum requirements Try using the direct link instead Login Issues Verify your credentials with your administrator Ensure you’re using the full email format: username@leviathan.systems Check your internet connection Support If you encounter any issues:\nEmail: support@leviathan.systems In-App Support: Use the help or support section within the app Documentation: Visit our Support section for more help Features The iOS version of PCRMS Office includes:\nFull access to property management features Real-time synchronization with the web platform Push notifications for important updates Optimized interface for iPhone and iPad Offline mode for essential functions Secure authentication and data encryption Privacy \u0026 Security All data is encrypted in transit and at rest The app follows Apple’s strict privacy guidelines Your credentials are securely stored in the iOS Keychain Face ID and Touch ID support for quick, secure access",
