    "content": "Frequently Asked Questions Common questions and answers about Leviathan PCRMS.\nGetting Started How do I access Leviathan PCRMS? Leviathan PCRMS is a web-based application. Simply navigate to the application URL provided by your administrator and log in with your credentials.\nWhat browsers are supported? Leviathan PCRMS works best with modern browsers including Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Edge.\nDo I need to install anything? No installation required! Leviathan PCRMS is a web application that runs entirely in your browser.\nAccount \u0026 Access How do I reset my password? Use the “Forgot Password” link on the login page, or contact your system administrator.\nWho can I contact for access issues? Please contact our support team at support@leviathan.systems\nTroubleshooting Where can I get help? Contact our support team at support@leviathan.systems for assistance with any issues.",
